"supported Lightning-address endpoints, and Clear payment requests open payment review "
"automatically; payment still requires confirmation. Other codes go to a separate interpretation "
"page. EAN, UPC and DataMatrix camera decoding depends on browser support. Preserve ASCII group "
"separators when pasting GS1 element strings."
